WEBVTT

01:18.220 --> 01:21.850
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:22.000 --> 01:24.930
[Episode 30]

01:25.070 --> 01:25.930
Director Fang.

01:26.370 --> 01:28.570
Actually, I'm not here to question you,

01:29.400 --> 01:31.590
but to make peace with myself.

01:33.000 --> 01:34.789
The flag that once guided me,

01:34.870 --> 01:36.020
that lighthouse,

01:36.240 --> 01:37.490
is gone now.

01:37.870 --> 01:39.120
But I'm not afraid,

01:40.479 --> 01:42.539
because I know my direction is right.

01:47.200 --> 01:48.120
So thank you.

01:49.710 --> 01:50.280
Goodbye.

02:09.720 --> 02:12.990
Based on the due diligence results
presented by Director Fang,

02:12.990 --> 02:17.340
and in line with He Jing's principle of
being responsible to clients,

02:17.460 --> 02:20.020
we advise Shanlifang Hotel Group

02:20.050 --> 02:23.240
to focus on business restructuring for now

02:23.560 --> 02:24.690
and suspend the IPO.

02:26.500 --> 02:28.000
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

02:27.000 --> 02:29.090
The IPO contract Shanlifang signed

02:28.000 --> 02:29.520
[IPO Underwriting and Listing
Engagement Agreement]

02:29.120 --> 02:29.870
with you

02:29.930 --> 02:30.800
is right here.

02:31.630 --> 02:32.780
During the due diligence process,

02:32.780 --> 02:34.910
if the underwriter identifies any issues,

02:34.910 --> 02:36.860
it should offer constructive suggestions.

02:36.860 --> 02:38.090
At this point, what you're doing

02:38.090 --> 02:39.690
is being irresponsible to the client—

02:39.690 --> 02:41.350
it's basically just
avoiding the issue entirely.

02:41.350 --> 02:42.360
Vice President Liao.

02:42.360 --> 02:44.329
In fact, it is quite normal for a company

02:44.329 --> 02:45.680
to encounter risks and shortcomings

02:45.680 --> 02:46.750
during its operations—

02:46.750 --> 02:49.510
just like how people inevitably fall ill
when they eat a varied diet.

02:49.510 --> 02:51.090
There's no need to be overly anxious.

02:51.090 --> 02:52.220
Actually, we're simply

02:52.220 --> 02:54.230
presenting the due diligence findings

02:54.230 --> 02:55.440
from this period

02:55.630 --> 02:56.870
and telling you

02:56.890 --> 02:58.310
the optimal option.

02:58.470 --> 03:00.660
Of course, you don't have to accept it.

03:01.560 --> 03:04.710
We also have another path

03:04.830 --> 03:05.890
available for you.

03:05.960 --> 03:06.720
What path?

03:07.130 --> 03:08.600
Ignore the operational issues

03:08.600 --> 03:09.960
and proceed with the IPO—

03:09.960 --> 03:10.980
then wait for a regulatory investigation
by the CSRC

03:10.980 --> 03:14.040
and an indefinitely long, uncertain
listing outcome.

03:14.200 --> 03:15.750
Are you threatening me?

03:16.360 --> 03:17.329
Don't forget—

03:17.510 --> 03:18.400
the problematic video

03:18.400 --> 03:20.200
was leaked by a He Jing employee.

03:20.750 --> 03:22.450
Do you really think firing her alone

03:22.450 --> 03:24.540
is enough of an explanation
for Shanlifang?

03:24.540 --> 03:25.550
Then do you believe

03:25.550 --> 03:27.750
0.33 was definitely telling the truth?

03:27.950 --> 03:30.170
As for how 0.33 got this problematic video

03:30.170 --> 03:31.810
from our former employee,

03:31.960 --> 03:33.060
we have no idea.

03:33.100 --> 03:34.310
Is there any concrete evidence

03:34.310 --> 03:36.620
proving that it was our former employee

03:36.640 --> 03:38.250
who handed it over to him voluntarily?

03:38.250 --> 03:39.610
If that's really the case,

03:39.610 --> 03:41.829
our company, He Jing, is willing to
assume the responsibilities

03:41.829 --> 03:43.440
we should bear
in accordance with the contract.

03:43.440 --> 03:45.150
But what if that's not the case?

03:45.150 --> 03:48.340
What if it was 0.33
who deceived our former employee

03:48.370 --> 03:51.030
and tricked her into
handing over these videos?

03:51.090 --> 03:53.520
What if it was actually caused by
our employee's negligence?

03:53.520 --> 03:54.590
Even so,

03:54.620 --> 03:56.630
our employees still carried out

03:56.650 --> 04:00.120
the due diligence work
in a responsible and professional manner.

04:00.120 --> 04:01.390
But on the other hand,

04:01.620 --> 04:03.220
if it hadn't been for
the information asymmetry

04:03.220 --> 04:05.090
between the client and the underwriter,

04:05.090 --> 04:06.570
then we wouldn't have been the ones

04:06.570 --> 04:10.170
uncovering those problematic videos
in the first place, right?

04:11.730 --> 04:12.750
Shouldn't these risk-related materials

04:12.750 --> 04:14.090
have been provided by you,

04:14.090 --> 04:16.089
or already addressed and rectified

04:16.100 --> 04:17.230
in your daily operations,

04:17.230 --> 04:19.839
rather than discovered
through our investigation?

04:19.839 --> 04:21.490
So, Vice President Liao,

04:21.589 --> 04:23.320
I really have to question this—

04:24.740 --> 04:27.080
do you even have genuine intent
to go public?

04:27.080 --> 04:29.210
Fang Yun! He Jing Securities is
the Party B.

04:29.210 --> 04:30.670
Please mind your manners.

04:31.040 --> 04:31.900
Even as Party B,

04:32.140 --> 04:33.290
we are not responsible for

04:33.290 --> 04:35.040
bearing the severe penalties
imposed by the CSRC

04:35.040 --> 04:37.830
due to Party A's operational issues.

04:38.330 --> 04:39.730
So, Vice President Liao,

04:40.250 --> 04:42.780
please try to put yourself in our shoes

04:42.810 --> 04:45.600
and understand the awkward position
we, as Party B, are in.

04:45.600 --> 04:47.330
-You...
-Vice President Liao.

04:47.780 --> 04:49.580
Regarding the due diligence process,

04:49.580 --> 04:51.710
what He Jing has stated is all factual.

04:52.190 --> 04:53.240
Our company, Zhizhong, also believes

04:53.240 --> 04:55.560
that the most appropriate
and safest course of action at present

04:55.560 --> 04:56.620
is rectification.

05:01.360 --> 05:02.000
So...

05:02.470 --> 05:05.120
As the saying goes, "to do a good job,
one must first sharpen one's tools."

05:05.120 --> 05:08.980
Perhaps you could take a little more time
to reconsider it carefully?

05:14.590 --> 05:23.130
[Shanlifang Hotel Group]

05:17.430 --> 05:20.330
Thank you for your trust,
Vice President Liao.

05:20.880 --> 05:22.330
Based on our discussion,

05:22.390 --> 05:23.360
after we go back,

05:23.380 --> 05:25.610
He Jing will promptly draft
a rectification plan.

05:25.610 --> 05:26.100
Here.

05:28.400 --> 05:30.530
We will contact you in a timely manner.

05:31.080 --> 05:31.680
All right.

05:35.900 --> 05:37.380
Vice President Liao, we'll be leaving too.

05:37.380 --> 05:38.090
Wait.

05:48.820 --> 05:49.900
Vice President Liao.

05:49.900 --> 05:51.760
I believe someone as astute as you

05:51.950 --> 05:53.720
wouldn't focus all your energy

05:53.740 --> 05:55.909
on holding the underwriters accountable,
right?

05:55.909 --> 05:57.330
What are you trying to say?

05:57.330 --> 05:59.720
Group-level rectification is
the top priority, of course.

05:59.720 --> 06:01.560
But at the same time, you should also
think about

06:01.560 --> 06:03.560
why those negative public opinions

06:04.350 --> 06:05.880
emerged in the first place.

06:09.340 --> 06:11.650
That's all I can say. Excuse me.

06:24.750 --> 06:27.390
Next, let's welcome the dance troupe

06:24.850 --> 06:28.560
[Pudong New Area, Shanghai]

06:27.390 --> 06:30.240
to present a wonderful
sailor dance performance!

06:28.580 --> 06:33.310
["Dance a New Style"—
Community Square Dance Competition]

06:30.390 --> 06:32.159
Please give them a big round of applause!

06:32.159 --> 06:33.560
Let's go!

06:33.450 --> 06:34.909
[Zera Square Dance]
[You're the center of attention!]

06:40.390 --> 06:42.460
[Shanghai Pudong New Area]

06:42.490 --> 06:44.800
["Dance a New Style"—
Community Square Dance Competition]

06:47.020 --> 06:47.990
[Shanghai Pudong New Area]

06:48.010 --> 06:49.630
["Dance a New Style"—
Community Square Dance Competition]

07:05.410 --> 07:06.960
We're up next.

07:08.620 --> 07:11.200
Well, just dance

07:11.220 --> 07:12.830
the way we usually practice later.

07:12.830 --> 07:14.240
Everyone, don't be nervous.

07:14.240 --> 07:15.690
With you here, we won't be nervous.

07:15.690 --> 07:16.360
Jun's mother,

07:16.360 --> 07:18.960
I think you're the most nervous one
on our team.

07:21.030 --> 07:21.960
Have some water.

07:23.160 --> 07:24.130
It's warm.

07:24.430 --> 07:25.670
What's going on?

07:31.010 --> 07:31.570
Mom.

07:32.310 --> 07:33.690
Yu's not feeling well.

07:34.630 --> 07:36.120
Hurry. How could this be?

07:36.830 --> 07:38.490
What's wrong with you, kid?

07:38.570 --> 07:39.490
Are you okay?

07:39.520 --> 07:42.070
-Why's she feeling unwell all of a sudden?
-What's wrong?

07:42.070 --> 07:43.890
She was fine just a moment ago,
then suddenly became like this.

07:43.890 --> 07:45.220
It's probably nothing.

07:45.630 --> 07:47.390
I might've just caught a chill

07:47.390 --> 07:49.070
from eating while walking

07:49.700 --> 07:50.730
this morning.

07:51.070 --> 07:52.510
What did you eat?

07:53.120 --> 07:53.720
I...

07:54.950 --> 07:56.480
Do you feel like vomitting?

07:58.630 --> 08:00.680
Excuse us. Make way.

08:00.680 --> 08:02.310
Yu, this way, this way. Make way!

08:02.310 --> 08:03.800
Make way! Come on.

08:17.020 --> 08:18.770
Mom, how is Yu?

08:19.370 --> 08:21.100
She's even vomitting bile.

08:21.910 --> 08:22.510
Wait.

08:23.030 --> 08:24.320
A-Are you okay?

08:24.320 --> 08:25.390
Hurry, hurry, give me the tissue.

08:25.390 --> 08:26.510
Mom, in a pinch,

08:26.510 --> 08:28.170
I'll take her to the hospital.

08:33.820 --> 08:35.150
What are you doing, Mom?

08:36.030 --> 08:36.789
You brat.

08:36.830 --> 08:38.159
Mom, what's this about?

08:38.480 --> 08:39.480
What did you do?

08:39.500 --> 08:40.770
W-What did I do?

08:40.789 --> 08:42.059
Is she pregnant?

08:42.600 --> 08:43.909
Mom, what are you thinking?

08:43.909 --> 08:44.910
She already said

08:44.930 --> 08:47.030
she caught a cold
and has an upset stomach.

08:47.030 --> 08:49.510
Are you trying to force things
so that it's a done deal

08:49.510 --> 08:51.570
and I can do nothing about it anymore?

08:51.630 --> 08:52.960
Mom, Yu is feeling so uncomfortable,

08:52.960 --> 08:54.890
yet you're here
saying these nonsensical things.

08:54.890 --> 08:57.030
How about l just withdraw from
the competition?

08:57.030 --> 08:57.910
Are you threatening me?

08:57.910 --> 08:59.080
-Are you threatening me?
-I'm not.

08:59.080 --> 08:59.840
I'm not.

09:01.030 --> 09:02.440
Are you telling me the truth?

09:02.440 --> 09:04.000
I'm not lying, Mom.

09:04.330 --> 09:06.790
I swear, it's definitely not
what you think.

09:16.400 --> 09:17.190
Are you okay?

09:17.210 --> 09:18.940
How is she?

09:19.780 --> 09:20.740
Are you feeling better?

09:20.740 --> 09:22.030
Let's go to the hospital
if you can't hold on.

09:22.030 --> 09:23.910
-Yes, let's go to the hospital.
-We should go to the hospital.

09:23.910 --> 09:25.310
Let's go to the hospital.

09:25.740 --> 09:26.740
Let's go.

09:28.960 --> 09:30.240
It's okay. I can do it.

09:30.280 --> 09:34.940
[Square Dance]

09:30.930 --> 09:32.990
Come on. It's your turn to go on stage.

09:33.340 --> 09:34.930
Are you sure you are okay?

09:35.600 --> 09:36.240
I'm sure.

09:36.460 --> 09:39.700
[Square Dance]

09:36.980 --> 09:37.670
Alright, alright.

09:37.670 --> 09:39.080
Come on, let's go.

09:39.080 --> 09:39.890
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

09:39.890 --> 09:41.800
Let's... Let's go. Come on.

09:43.320 --> 09:44.520
Let's hurry over too.

09:45.080 --> 09:45.740
Be careful.

09:45.770 --> 09:46.370
Let's go.

10:02.520 --> 10:04.480
[Zera Square Dance]
[You're the center of attention!]

12:03.020 --> 12:04.230
[Zera Dance Troupe]

12:24.030 --> 12:24.790
Excuse me. Excuse me.

12:24.790 --> 12:25.790
Great job. Great job.

12:25.790 --> 12:26.390
Here. Careful.

12:26.390 --> 12:27.200
Excuse us. Make way.

12:27.200 --> 12:29.100
-Yes. There are stairs here.
-Excuse me.

12:29.100 --> 12:30.530
Yu did well. She held on.

12:30.550 --> 12:31.790
Yu held on.

12:32.030 --> 12:32.720
Are you okay?

12:32.720 --> 12:33.440
I'm okay.

12:34.150 --> 12:35.210
Thank you, Auntie.

12:35.480 --> 12:36.670
Don't mention it.

12:36.670 --> 12:37.240
Mom,

12:37.510 --> 12:39.170
thank goodness you were here.

12:39.510 --> 12:41.000
-You...
-Let's go.

12:41.630 --> 12:42.230
It's okay.

12:43.200 --> 12:43.870
Yu!

12:44.630 --> 12:45.500
I'll take her to the hospital.

12:45.500 --> 12:47.600
Yes, right. You'd better
go to the hospital.

12:47.600 --> 12:48.440
Be careful.

13:08.000 --> 13:09.060
That's all, right?

13:12.120 --> 13:13.690
Apart from some data

13:13.710 --> 13:16.390
left with Shanlifang
for rectification purposes,

13:16.390 --> 13:18.390
I've brought over everything else.

13:19.630 --> 13:20.160
Alright.

13:22.000 --> 13:24.400
Take it and archive it for record-keeping.

13:25.670 --> 13:26.360
Okay, Boss.

13:32.550 --> 13:33.120
Boss,

13:33.520 --> 13:36.630
I heard Qian Fei has been placed on
the investment bank blacklist.

13:36.630 --> 13:37.360
Is that true?

13:39.360 --> 13:41.720
We're no longer co-working with He Jing,

13:41.740 --> 13:44.270
so let's not discuss these things
privately.

13:45.920 --> 13:48.180
I just feel like she has all that ability
but nowhere to put it to use.

13:48.180 --> 13:49.480
It feels pretty unfair.

13:49.480 --> 13:50.200
What,

13:51.200 --> 13:53.330
you want to find her a job or something?

13:54.720 --> 13:55.760
With you here, Boss,

13:55.760 --> 13:57.600
it wouldn't be my turn anyway.

13:58.340 --> 14:00.400
Got it, I'll stop talking about this.

14:28.810 --> 14:30.070
I know this world is not

14:30.420 --> 14:31.920
simply black and white,

14:32.550 --> 14:33.510
but I also know

14:34.150 --> 14:35.360
that deep down,

14:36.000 --> 14:39.200
everyone's able to distinguish
between black and white.

14:39.680 --> 14:41.450
The flag that once guided me,

14:41.470 --> 14:42.580
that lighthouse,

14:42.840 --> 14:44.030
is gone now.

14:44.480 --> 14:45.680
But I won't be afraid,

14:47.150 --> 14:49.210
because I know my direction is right.

15:09.270 --> 15:11.250
[Marketing Director's Office]

15:25.840 --> 15:28.170
Shanlifang has officially entered
the rectification process.

15:28.170 --> 15:29.970
You can proceed to the next step.

15:31.390 --> 15:32.080
Also,

15:34.510 --> 15:37.170
is it possible to withdraw the funds
in advance?

15:43.960 --> 15:44.750
Thank you.

15:44.770 --> 15:46.130
Please come again.

15:55.200 --> 15:56.200
Hello, Jingjing.

15:56.250 --> 15:58.010
Hello, happy birthday.

16:01.080 --> 16:04.030
I completely forgot
it was my birthday today.

16:04.200 --> 16:04.960
Thank you.

16:05.480 --> 16:08.840
I've been too busy lately, truly.

16:08.840 --> 16:10.750
I haven't even had time to be with you.

16:10.750 --> 16:12.340
You're not mad at me, are you?

16:12.340 --> 16:13.340
Of course I am.

16:14.870 --> 16:16.160
Just kidding.

16:16.250 --> 16:18.090
With you and Yu being so caring toward me

16:18.090 --> 16:18.950
and even helping me out,

16:18.950 --> 16:19.940
how could I possibly be mad at you?

16:19.940 --> 16:21.780
I happen to be with her today.

16:25.040 --> 16:27.130
I have a super important exhibition today,

16:27.130 --> 16:28.460
so I called her over to help me.

16:28.460 --> 16:28.990
It's Fei.

16:29.870 --> 16:31.700
Happy birthday, sweetie.

16:32.370 --> 16:33.660
Thank you, Yu.

16:34.930 --> 16:36.690
Sorry I can't celebrate with you today,

16:36.690 --> 16:38.240
but I'll make it up to you later, okay?

16:38.240 --> 16:39.900
Right, we'll make it up to you.

16:40.360 --> 16:41.790
Of course you have to.

16:41.820 --> 16:43.550
And you have to make it a big one.

16:44.380 --> 16:46.470
No problem. She's paying.

16:47.020 --> 16:49.070
Settle today's bill first.

16:49.100 --> 16:50.100
Sure. No problem.

16:51.400 --> 16:52.780
Alright, I'll let you get back to work.

16:52.780 --> 16:54.600
-Okay. Bye.
-Bye.

16:55.040 --> 16:56.280
I've finished. Wanna take a look?

16:56.280 --> 16:56.850
Let's go.

17:02.270 --> 17:05.270
[Happy birthday.]

17:03.070 --> 17:03.790
Who is it?

17:04.450 --> 17:06.310
Since they know today is my birthday,

17:06.310 --> 17:08.160
it must be someone I know.

17:09.230 --> 17:12.500
Sorry, the number you have dialed
is no longer in service.

17:13.310 --> 17:14.240
Out of service?

17:15.310 --> 17:18.310
A phone that's out of service
can still send messages?

17:24.180 --> 17:25.190
I'm back.

17:25.210 --> 17:27.540
Hurry up. I've been waiting for you
to eat.

17:41.000 --> 17:42.260
Did you make this?

17:44.190 --> 17:46.120
Would you believe me if I said I did?

17:47.160 --> 17:48.200
Yeah, right.

17:48.220 --> 17:49.620
It's obviously takeout.

17:53.850 --> 17:55.250
You bought a new laptop?

17:56.800 --> 17:57.750
Well, it was only because

17:57.750 --> 17:59.410
you broke my laptop last time.

18:00.760 --> 18:01.480
Wait, wait.

18:02.270 --> 18:03.180
I didn't break your...

18:03.180 --> 18:04.080
It was Zhao De who broke it.

18:04.080 --> 18:05.940
It has nothing to do with me, okay?

18:06.080 --> 18:07.490
Anyway, now that I bought this new laptop,

18:07.490 --> 18:09.350
don't even think about touching it.

18:09.350 --> 18:10.640
I won't.

18:11.700 --> 18:12.440
By the way,

18:13.480 --> 18:14.440
after you brought that old one

18:14.440 --> 18:15.720
back from Shanlifang,

18:15.720 --> 18:16.750
didn't you try

18:16.750 --> 18:18.440
logging into Weibo again or something?

18:18.440 --> 18:20.330
I did, but I couldn't log in.

18:21.580 --> 18:22.360
Forget it.

18:23.160 --> 18:24.000
Anyway,

18:24.720 --> 18:25.920
starting from today,

18:25.960 --> 18:27.020
starting from now,

18:27.440 --> 18:29.160
both at work and in life,

18:29.980 --> 18:31.910
I'm going to be a brand-new person.

18:31.960 --> 18:32.680
Well said.

18:36.590 --> 18:37.720
Let's drink to that.

18:38.550 --> 18:39.950
We're drinking red wine?

18:40.590 --> 18:42.650
It's your birthday after all.

18:42.960 --> 18:44.030
I must improve

18:44.030 --> 18:46.170
the quality and style of your life.

18:46.920 --> 18:48.480
You remembered my birthday too?

18:48.480 --> 18:49.620
Of course I did.

18:56.590 --> 18:58.750
Wait, besides me,

18:58.750 --> 19:00.200
w-who else remembered?

19:00.750 --> 19:02.280
Yu and Jingjing, of course.

19:04.050 --> 19:05.160
And an unknown number.

19:05.160 --> 19:06.420
I don't know who it was.

19:07.590 --> 19:08.650
An unknown number?

19:10.160 --> 19:11.760
It was this person. This one.

19:12.210 --> 19:13.690
See, they just sent me a "Happy Birthday",

19:13.200 --> 19:14.870
[Happy birthday.]

19:13.720 --> 19:15.350
and when I called back right away,

19:15.350 --> 19:16.080
the phone was out of service.

19:16.080 --> 19:16.880
Weird, right?

19:20.400 --> 19:22.400
Never mind. L-Let's eat first.

19:22.420 --> 19:23.880
I need to use the restroom.

19:43.120 --> 19:45.120
Hurry up. Did you fall in?

19:46.130 --> 19:47.930
I'll be out in a second. A second.

19:48.000 --> 19:48.550
Well,

19:48.890 --> 19:50.380
I'm going to change my clothes first.

19:50.380 --> 19:51.880
Make sure you're out

19:53.120 --> 19:54.380
before I come back out.

20:12.110 --> 20:12.670
[Recent calls]

20:12.700 --> 20:13.380
[Delete contact]

20:13.410 --> 20:14.760
[Recent calls]

20:19.830 --> 20:23.960
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

20:25.400 --> 20:29.110
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

20:30.270 --> 20:34.920
♪ Happy birthday, happy birthday ♪

20:36.310 --> 20:42.160
♪ Happy birthday to my landlady ♪

20:38.650 --> 20:40.730
♪ I really miss you ♪

20:41.290 --> 20:42.440
♪ My heart is pounding fast ♪

20:43.030 --> 20:45.910
♪ Syncing my breath
to a frequency that longs for you ♪

20:43.590 --> 20:48.640
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

20:46.630 --> 20:47.740
♪ I love you so much ♪

20:48.550 --> 20:51.130
♪ The only you in the whole world ♪

20:51.840 --> 20:54.990
♪ Living in my heart ♪

20:56.480 --> 20:59.990
♪ The stars see through
the tenderness of the night ♪

20:57.880 --> 20:59.250
I'm so touched.

21:00.110 --> 21:01.810
I became single this year,

21:00.630 --> 21:03.410
♪ Lighten the streets of the city ♪

21:02.480 --> 21:04.390
and Yu and Jingjing don't have time

21:03.870 --> 21:07.430
♪ The night breeze blows through
every window ♪

21:04.410 --> 21:05.610
to celebrate with me.

21:05.850 --> 21:07.670
I didn't expect I'd still get a cake.

21:07.670 --> 21:10.950
♪ Watching the two's
little universe secretly ♪

21:09.030 --> 21:10.260
Is it really that moving?

21:10.260 --> 21:12.020
Come on, make a wish

21:11.260 --> 21:14.530
♪ Meeting will flirt with lazy waiting ♪

21:12.050 --> 21:13.650
before the candles burn out.

21:15.150 --> 21:18.120
♪ Love lights the fireworks ♪

21:18.610 --> 21:21.740
♪ I fell in love with you
without permission ♪

21:22.430 --> 21:26.040
♪ I began to doodle on
this romantic cabin ♪

21:27.760 --> 21:29.710
♪ I really miss you ♪

21:28.450 --> 21:29.350
Done.

21:29.500 --> 21:30.780
Let's blow them out together.

21:30.480 --> 21:31.640
♪ My heart is pounding fast ♪

21:30.920 --> 21:31.640
Together?

21:32.190 --> 21:35.000
♪ Syncing my breath
to a frequency that longs for you ♪

21:32.520 --> 21:32.900
Come on.

21:32.900 --> 21:33.430
Alright.

21:34.350 --> 21:35.010
Three,

21:35.750 --> 21:36.900
♪ I love you so much ♪

21:37.480 --> 21:38.160
two,

21:37.550 --> 21:40.410
♪ The only you in the whole world ♪

21:41.510 --> 21:42.030
one.

22:02.130 --> 22:04.210
♪ I really miss you ♪

22:04.770 --> 22:05.850
♪ My heart is pounding fast ♪

22:06.510 --> 22:09.390
♪ Syncing my breath
to a frequency that longs for you ♪

22:09.140 --> 22:09.820
Yummy.

22:10.110 --> 22:11.220
♪ I love you so much ♪

22:10.550 --> 22:12.370
This is really a wonderful birthday.

22:12.030 --> 22:14.610
♪ The only you in the whole world ♪

22:14.790 --> 22:16.120
You're so easily moved.

22:17.460 --> 22:22.160
♪ Living in my heart ♪

22:18.440 --> 22:20.350
So what did you wish for just now?

22:20.370 --> 22:21.500
You looked quite sincere.

22:21.500 --> 22:23.110
Of course I was sincere.

22:23.650 --> 22:24.560
I hope

22:25.310 --> 22:27.960
I can find someone
who truly knows and loves me,

22:28.640 --> 22:30.110
and then get married.

22:31.640 --> 22:33.240
Just get married right away?

22:33.350 --> 22:34.950
No dating first or anything?

22:35.000 --> 22:36.640
Of course I'll date first.

22:37.070 --> 22:39.680
It's just that my past relationships
really hurt me.

22:39.680 --> 22:42.110
You know, I'm not that young anymore—

22:42.270 --> 22:44.550
I can't go through all that turmoil again.

22:44.550 --> 22:46.970
Momentary attraction is all superficial.

22:48.260 --> 22:50.550
It's just chemicals and fleeting passion.

22:50.550 --> 22:52.240
Only when two people share the same values

22:52.240 --> 22:53.550
can a relationship last

22:53.550 --> 22:54.880
and support each other through life.

22:54.880 --> 22:56.160
You don't get it, do you?

22:56.160 --> 22:57.110
Only a relationship like that

22:57.110 --> 22:58.110
is truly worth it.

23:00.110 --> 23:01.640
Ever since I kissed Qian Fei that night...

23:01.640 --> 23:02.350
So yummy.

23:02.350 --> 23:03.710
I became certain of one thing.

23:03.710 --> 23:04.360
So good.

23:04.380 --> 23:06.270
-I've fallen for her.
-I want one more.

23:06.270 --> 23:07.870
This feeling is involuntary

23:08.110 --> 23:09.370
and beyond my control.

23:09.750 --> 23:10.640
But what she longs for

23:10.640 --> 23:12.790
is a lifetime of mutual support
and companionship.

23:12.790 --> 23:13.850
Can someone like me

23:14.720 --> 23:16.450
really meet her expectations?

23:23.200 --> 23:25.000
-Qian Fei, actually I…
-Hold on.

23:26.270 --> 23:26.930
It's my dad.

23:28.680 --> 23:29.440
Hello, Dad.

23:30.240 --> 23:31.680
Fei, happy birthday.

23:32.070 --> 23:33.200
Thank you, Dad.

23:33.350 --> 23:34.370
Have you eaten cake yet?

23:34.370 --> 23:36.030
Yeah, I'm eating it right now.

23:39.830 --> 23:40.440
Okay.

23:43.440 --> 23:45.280
Alright, go back to your meal.

23:46.200 --> 23:46.790
Bye-bye.

23:50.550 --> 23:52.640
My dad—my dad, not me—

23:52.830 --> 23:55.310
asked me to have a drink with you
on his behalf.

23:55.310 --> 23:56.480
Then I'll drink to that first.

23:56.480 --> 23:57.010
Alright.

24:25.440 --> 24:25.970
Qian Fei.

24:29.830 --> 24:30.560
Actually...

24:34.440 --> 24:35.240
What's wrong?

24:37.640 --> 24:39.040
Are you not feeling well?

24:42.570 --> 24:43.190
I...

24:49.830 --> 24:51.720
I think I remember now.

24:54.260 --> 24:55.670
It was you, right?

24:59.260 --> 25:00.900
It... It really was you?

25:01.310 --> 25:02.510
So I wasn't dreaming.

25:03.030 --> 25:04.590
Then why didn't you tell me?

25:06.820 --> 25:08.440
It's not what you think, Qian Fei.

25:08.440 --> 25:08.960
Wait, wait, wait.

25:08.960 --> 25:09.510
Let me explain.

25:09.510 --> 25:10.460
-I'm feeling too dizzy right now.
-I...

25:10.460 --> 25:11.630
-I don't want to hear you speak anymore.
-Qian Fei.

25:11.630 --> 25:12.640
I feel so dizzy right now.

25:12.640 --> 25:14.220
Qian Fei. Qian Fei, let me explain.

25:14.220 --> 25:15.520
-Stop it!
-That day, I...

25:15.520 --> 25:17.340
That day, you... Qian Fei!

25:17.550 --> 25:18.950
Let me explain, Qian Fei.

25:25.110 --> 25:26.160
Why can you act as if

25:26.160 --> 25:27.550
nothing happened

25:27.550 --> 25:29.410
and keep showing up in front of me?

25:30.680 --> 25:32.200
I was just someone you used

25:32.200 --> 25:34.530
to vent your emotions when you were drunk.

25:35.420 --> 25:37.310
All those things you did for me before—

25:37.310 --> 25:38.770
what were they really for?

25:39.730 --> 25:45.670
♪ Whenever I look up ♪

25:40.550 --> 25:41.640
Was my honesty

25:41.640 --> 25:43.300
just ridiculous in your eyes?

25:46.690 --> 25:52.700
♪ I ran into your eyes ♪

25:54.110 --> 25:59.980
♪ Trying to catch that pleasant light ♪

25:54.720 --> 25:56.320
What am I supposed to say now?

25:57.460 --> 25:59.080
Say I like you?

25:59.330 --> 26:00.350
Say I'm a coward

26:00.830 --> 26:01.680
and afraid my feelings

26:01.260 --> 26:07.330
♪ To embrace that fleeting moment
of happiness ♪

26:01.680 --> 26:03.010
will cause you trouble?

26:04.240 --> 26:05.200
Say I'm willing to

26:05.200 --> 26:06.360
make an effort for you,

26:06.360 --> 26:07.820
but marriage is not a game?

26:09.030 --> 26:15.470
♪ Sometimes I cry,
and sometimes I'm happy ♪

26:09.850 --> 26:11.030
No matter how I put it, it feels like

26:11.030 --> 26:13.160
I'm about to be kicked out of this home.

26:13.400 --> 26:14.600
Am I done for?

26:16.900 --> 26:23.010
♪ Sometimes I feel
I've captured the sweetness ♪

26:24.270 --> 26:30.130
♪ Sometimes, I run,
and sometimes, I fall ♪

26:31.330 --> 26:37.980
♪ Sometimes I feel
that having you is the best thing ♪

26:39.400 --> 26:44.900
♪ I've never loved anyone
like I love you ♪

26:45.980 --> 26:52.650
♪ Without any hesitation ♪

26:53.720 --> 27:00.330
♪ I've never been loved like you love me ♪

27:01.410 --> 27:07.600
♪ In short, I'll wait for my love ♪

27:09.390 --> 27:15.060
♪ I've never seen a bright sea like you ♪

27:16.280 --> 27:22.920
♪ Every minute is colorful ♪

27:21.680 --> 27:22.720
Qian Fei,

27:23.400 --> 27:25.520
how am I supposed to get along with you?

27:24.820 --> 27:30.080
♪ I've never experienced
such a warm love as yours ♪

27:26.350 --> 27:27.310
After today,

27:27.840 --> 27:29.000
in what capacity

27:29.000 --> 27:30.460
should I stay by your side?

27:31.020 --> 27:40.450
♪ In short, I won't let go of my hand ♪

27:31.350 --> 27:34.350
Will you really give me a chance
to remain by your side?

27:34.880 --> 27:36.680
Are you also troubled right now?

27:37.750 --> 27:38.920
If I leave you,

27:39.480 --> 27:41.010
will you still be troubled?

27:41.880 --> 27:44.610
And if I leave you, what kind of future
will I face?

27:47.840 --> 27:49.810
[Ma Li]

27:55.870 --> 27:58.110
[Ma Li]

28:04.590 --> 28:06.390
Yifei, something terrible happened.

28:06.390 --> 28:08.200
Our project has basically
come to a standstill.

28:08.200 --> 28:10.200
No one knows why—it's really weird.

28:10.440 --> 28:12.750
The villagers suddenly
wanted to drive us away.

28:12.750 --> 28:15.070
I've tried everything I could,
but nothing's worked.

28:15.070 --> 28:17.380
Think about it—we've invested
so much money upfront.

28:17.380 --> 28:19.350
There's no way
we can just let it all go to waste, right?

28:19.350 --> 28:20.920
You really need to come back right away.

28:20.920 --> 28:23.580
Only with you here can we have someone
to rely on.

28:25.270 --> 28:25.900
Okay.

28:27.000 --> 28:28.930
I'll head over as soon as possible.

29:30.820 --> 29:32.620
[Last-Minute Business Trip]

29:33.400 --> 29:35.000
Last-minute business trip?

29:35.430 --> 29:36.500
[Last-Minute Business Trip]

30:32.230 --> 30:33.340
To hide from me,

30:34.760 --> 30:36.760
he actually went on a business trip?

30:59.690 --> 31:00.660
[Dai Xi]

31:06.310 --> 31:07.270
Hello, Dai Xi?

31:08.200 --> 31:09.310
Hello, Qian Fei.

31:09.460 --> 31:11.290
Sorry to bother you.

31:11.640 --> 31:14.160
I have a document here
that seems to have some issues.

31:14.160 --> 31:16.640
You were the one who was in touch with
Mr. Li about this earlier,

31:16.640 --> 31:18.370
but I can't reach him right now.

31:18.480 --> 31:21.270
Could you help me verify it?

31:22.440 --> 31:23.030
Sure.

31:23.110 --> 31:25.030
I'll get back to you
once I've confirmed it.

31:25.030 --> 31:26.550
Thank you, Qian Fei.

31:26.570 --> 31:28.700
I know you're not obligated to help me.

31:29.010 --> 31:31.410
I just like to see things through
to the end.

31:32.240 --> 31:33.290
Let's leave it at that for now.

31:33.290 --> 31:35.620
Okay, I'll wait to hear from you. Bye-bye.

31:35.880 --> 31:36.740
Okay, bye-bye.

31:43.930 --> 31:45.970
[Dai Xi]

31:46.290 --> 31:47.000
[Shanlifang Hotel Group Co., Ltd.]

31:47.000 --> 31:47.610
[Draft Sponsorship Letter for the IPO]
[He Jing Securities]

31:47.780 --> 31:49.510
[Draft Prospectus]

32:04.820 --> 32:05.690
[Pretentious Li]

32:11.200 --> 32:14.510
Sorry, the number you dialed
is powered off.

32:14.670 --> 32:17.670
His phone is off? Is it really necessary
to go that far?

32:27.410 --> 32:31.050
[Zhao De]

32:42.460 --> 32:44.610
Hello, Qian Fei. What's wrong?

32:45.010 --> 32:45.870
Um,

32:45.890 --> 32:47.510
do you know where Li Yifei went
on his business trip?

32:47.510 --> 32:49.040
I can't reach him right now.

32:49.130 --> 32:50.030
Business trip?

32:50.310 --> 32:51.370
I didn't know that.

32:51.830 --> 32:53.090
You don't know either?

32:54.510 --> 32:56.070
Maybe he was in a rush

32:56.090 --> 32:58.220
and hasn't had time to report to me yet.

32:59.590 --> 33:00.270
But

33:00.690 --> 33:02.110
my supervisor definitely knows.

33:02.110 --> 33:03.640
I'll ask him for you in a bit.

33:03.720 --> 33:04.750
Don't worry.

33:05.080 --> 33:07.310
He might be on a plane
and can't answer the phone.

33:07.310 --> 33:07.920
Okay.

33:09.240 --> 33:12.240
Qian Fei, is it urgent?

33:12.830 --> 33:14.760
There's a piece of data from He Jing

33:14.830 --> 33:16.830
that I was asked to confirm with him.

33:18.920 --> 33:20.850
I have all of He Jing's files archived.

33:20.850 --> 33:23.170
If you send it to me,
I can check it for you.

33:24.240 --> 33:25.440
Sure, that works.

33:27.300 --> 33:29.960
Then do you still need me to contact Boss
for you?

33:30.790 --> 33:32.000
No need. Thank you.

33:33.270 --> 33:34.130
Okay. Bye-bye.

33:38.680 --> 33:39.830
That Li Yifei.

34:04.750 --> 34:05.880
You... You two...

34:06.710 --> 34:07.440
For real?

34:07.850 --> 34:10.110
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

34:08.400 --> 34:09.280
Jingjing.

34:10.550 --> 34:11.280
Alright, alright.

34:11.280 --> 34:12.610
Let's not talk about it.

34:13.230 --> 34:15.110
Isn't he just on a business trip?

34:15.110 --> 34:16.400
And he's with Lu Ze.

34:16.590 --> 34:17.400
It'll be fine.

34:17.710 --> 34:20.239
You two can have a good talk
after he gets back.

34:20.460 --> 34:22.900
Talk about what? How?

34:25.400 --> 34:26.360
I think

34:26.630 --> 34:29.030
he's just using the business trip
as an excuse to avoid me.

34:29.030 --> 34:30.400
This is so awkward.

34:31.030 --> 34:32.580
I really regret

34:32.690 --> 34:34.840
blurting it out like that.

34:35.630 --> 34:36.650
Now look.

34:36.880 --> 34:40.280
It makes it seem like
I'm forcing him to take responsibility.

34:40.659 --> 34:41.310
Alright.

34:41.810 --> 34:43.650
Let's say he is avoiding you.

34:44.340 --> 34:45.679
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

34:44.400 --> 34:46.130
Then how do you feel about that?

34:48.710 --> 34:49.550
Well,

34:50.710 --> 34:51.820
I feel a bit embarrassed.

34:51.820 --> 34:53.550
And honestly, really awkward.

34:55.050 --> 34:58.720
I also feel a little upset

34:59.800 --> 35:00.730
and frustrated.

35:02.280 --> 35:03.710
Forget it. I don't want to think about it
anymore.

35:03.710 --> 35:05.630
I really shouldn't dwell on this.

35:05.960 --> 35:08.000
Anyway, when he comes back,

35:08.440 --> 35:10.740
if he doesn't want to live with me anymore
and decides to move out,

35:10.740 --> 35:12.340
I'll just find a new tenant.

35:13.220 --> 35:14.920
If he still wants to live here,

35:16.210 --> 35:18.840
then I'll just keep my distance from him.

35:19.420 --> 35:21.420
Otherwise, it would be too awkward.

35:27.330 --> 35:28.140
Fei,

35:28.630 --> 35:29.710
I think

35:30.280 --> 35:32.480
you're already under Li Yifei's spell.

35:38.410 --> 35:40.880
You guys are just scammers!

35:41.160 --> 35:43.920
You just want to pocket
our government subsidies.

35:43.920 --> 35:45.690
Will you really help us make money?

35:45.690 --> 35:46.630
No, you won't!

35:46.680 --> 35:47.050
Right.

35:47.050 --> 35:48.000
Don't you all agree?

35:48.000 --> 35:48.440
Yes!

35:48.440 --> 35:48.960
Wait, wait.

35:48.960 --> 35:50.070
Calm down, everyone. Please calm down.

35:50.070 --> 35:51.030
Calm down, everyone.

35:51.030 --> 35:52.480
Wait, listen to me. Please listen to me.

35:52.480 --> 35:53.960
The government does provide subsidies,

35:53.960 --> 35:55.880
but we've spent them all on the project—

35:55.880 --> 35:57.670
hardware, software,
installation, maintenance.

35:57.670 --> 35:58.670
You didn't pay for any of it, right?

35:58.670 --> 36:00.880
-Where are you?
-You didn't spend a penny, right?

36:00.880 --> 36:01.960
We really aren't scammers.

36:01.960 --> 36:03.440
-Please trust us.
-Where?

36:06.230 --> 36:07.670
Just look at this camera.

36:07.820 --> 36:09.550
You want to do livestreams, right?

36:09.550 --> 36:11.070
We can do livestreams too.

36:11.090 --> 36:12.240
I have a phone too.

36:12.270 --> 36:14.110
Everyone has a phone, right?

36:14.140 --> 36:15.410
We can livestream too.

36:15.480 --> 36:16.300
We can stream ourselves.

36:16.300 --> 36:17.080
Calm down, everyone.

36:17.080 --> 36:18.260
What we're doing

36:18.320 --> 36:19.800
is completely different from
livestreaming, okay?

36:19.800 --> 36:20.760
Let me explain.

36:20.760 --> 36:22.360
Save it! I'm telling you.

36:22.380 --> 36:23.580
Such empty talk—

36:23.710 --> 36:25.040
we don't want to hear it!

36:25.070 --> 36:25.900
Just leave!

36:25.960 --> 36:26.550
Yifei.

36:26.670 --> 36:28.960
You guys won't even listen to
their explanation.

36:28.960 --> 36:31.180
How is it empty talk?

36:32.000 --> 36:33.440
Look, here comes another one.

36:33.440 --> 36:34.770
Here comes another one.

36:35.190 --> 36:36.760
-Please calm down, okay?
-Come on.

36:36.760 --> 36:37.960
Excuse me. Excuse me.

36:38.550 --> 36:39.840
Alright, alright, alright.

36:39.840 --> 36:41.780
-We don't want to know what you want.
-No, no, no.

36:41.780 --> 36:42.930
Quiet down, everyone.

36:42.930 --> 36:44.330
Please quiet down first.

36:44.960 --> 36:47.300
You all know Xin You from the village,
right?

36:47.300 --> 36:48.800
He's my friend.

36:49.840 --> 36:50.990
A few months ago,

36:51.150 --> 36:51.710
I used

36:51.710 --> 36:53.520
a small camera like this

36:53.670 --> 36:56.120
to have an expert provide
remote guidance for him

36:56.120 --> 36:58.180
and treat his son for several months.

36:59.420 --> 37:01.020
The results were excellent.

37:01.070 --> 37:03.920
They're currently in Shanghai
for a follow-up visit

37:03.920 --> 37:05.400
and will be back in a few days.

37:05.400 --> 37:06.670
Don't try to play the sympathy card.

37:06.670 --> 37:08.730
That's not what we're talking about.

37:08.730 --> 37:10.060
It's not the same thing!

37:11.000 --> 37:12.670
How is it not the same thing?

37:13.670 --> 37:15.000
How else could his son, Xin Ba,

37:15.000 --> 37:16.510
receive treatment and guidance

37:16.510 --> 37:19.950
from international medical experts
in such a remote place?

37:20.320 --> 37:21.320
It's all thanks to

37:21.840 --> 37:23.150
the internet.

37:24.360 --> 37:26.570
The internet isn't just about

37:26.710 --> 37:28.710
livestreaming, as some people say.

37:28.800 --> 37:30.510
It is a way to quickly connect

37:30.530 --> 37:32.010
everyone on Earth,

37:32.040 --> 37:33.840
rapidly transmit information,

37:33.920 --> 37:36.550
and help each other
meet our respective needs.

37:37.830 --> 37:39.100
Let me tell you this:

37:39.590 --> 37:42.340
in the future, places without the internet

37:42.510 --> 37:44.590
will be the real "no-man's land."

37:45.480 --> 37:47.190
But this is not one of those places.

37:47.190 --> 37:48.070
Why?

37:49.190 --> 37:51.070
Because we should be grateful to this—

37:51.070 --> 37:52.880
grateful that a 5G tower

37:52.900 --> 37:54.030
has been built here.

37:54.150 --> 37:54.760
Because of it,

37:54.760 --> 37:57.000
we're able to pursue our own value.

37:58.230 --> 37:59.610
Isn't it still just livestreaming?

37:59.610 --> 38:00.410
That's right.

38:00.570 --> 38:01.720
It's just livestreaming anyway.

38:01.720 --> 38:02.780
Alright, alright.

38:02.920 --> 38:04.250
Then let me ask you guys.

38:04.270 --> 38:05.820
When I first came here,

38:05.850 --> 38:08.070
there were so many good things
in the market,

38:08.070 --> 38:09.600
but nobody was buying them.

38:09.640 --> 38:11.640
You have so many local specialties—

38:11.780 --> 38:13.260
why aren't you growing more?

38:13.260 --> 38:15.600
You're afraid that if you grow too much,
you won't be able to sell it all.

38:15.600 --> 38:16.800
Or to put it another way:

38:16.800 --> 38:19.560
you all have phones
and can do livestreams,

38:19.580 --> 38:21.750
but why does the problem still exist?

38:24.080 --> 38:25.380
Let me tell you why.

38:26.320 --> 38:26.920
First,

38:27.880 --> 38:29.530
you don't know how to get support

38:29.530 --> 38:31.170
from platform traffic.

38:31.400 --> 38:31.960
Second,

38:32.360 --> 38:34.840
you can't bring down transportation costs.

38:35.190 --> 38:35.790
Third,

38:35.960 --> 38:38.150
your traditional natural farming methods

38:38.150 --> 38:39.990
have high production costs,

38:40.020 --> 38:41.140
but consumers

38:41.590 --> 38:44.580
can't see the true value behind them.

38:44.830 --> 38:45.910
And fourth,

38:46.760 --> 38:49.090
those who buy things through livestreams

38:49.280 --> 38:51.690
care most about price,

38:52.360 --> 38:54.220
and quality only comes second.

38:54.250 --> 38:55.370
So let me ask you—

38:55.890 --> 38:57.420
under such circumstances,

38:57.630 --> 39:00.780
how exactly is livestreaming
supposed to increase income?

39:00.780 --> 39:01.800
And your product

39:01.800 --> 39:03.320
is able to solve this problem?

39:03.320 --> 39:04.470
I don't believe it anyway.

39:04.470 --> 39:05.310
Do you guys believe it?

39:05.310 --> 39:06.340
We don't!

39:06.670 --> 39:08.150
Who would believe that?
How is that even possible?

39:08.150 --> 39:09.840
Wait, just hear us out first.

39:10.230 --> 39:11.280
We came here

39:12.000 --> 39:14.350
with the goal of a win-win outcome.

39:14.560 --> 39:15.670
Even the best wine

39:16.190 --> 39:17.860
won't sell if it's hidden away.

39:17.860 --> 39:20.100
Since you're able to grow

39:20.120 --> 39:22.820
such high-quality, fresh,
and pollution-free agricultural products,

39:22.820 --> 39:24.820
you need to let more people see them.

39:24.890 --> 39:26.230
We want to show more people

39:26.230 --> 39:27.780
how they sprout,

39:28.000 --> 39:29.210
how they grow,

39:29.380 --> 39:30.780
how they are fertilized,

39:30.790 --> 39:32.310
how they are harvested—

39:32.590 --> 39:35.440
even every step of packaging
and transportation

39:35.720 --> 39:37.520
should be visible to consumers.

39:41.920 --> 39:43.360
Because people only trust

39:43.360 --> 39:45.110
what they see with their own eyes.

39:45.110 --> 39:46.000
Just like now—

39:46.280 --> 39:47.780
you don't believe what I'm saying at all;

39:47.780 --> 39:49.790
you only trust what you can see.

39:50.480 --> 39:52.250
Our target audience

39:52.760 --> 39:55.370
is those who are willing to
pay a higher price

39:55.800 --> 39:58.020
for higher quality.

39:58.040 --> 39:59.680
What we can offer

40:00.700 --> 40:03.160
is not only the best
agricultural products,

40:03.670 --> 40:05.350
but also the best experience.

40:06.700 --> 40:08.560
So that is what this camera is for?

40:09.480 --> 40:10.280
That's right.

40:10.760 --> 40:11.710
This camera

40:11.730 --> 40:14.210
is meant to let consumers around the world

40:14.410 --> 40:16.160
have that kind of experience,

40:16.710 --> 40:17.480
and

40:17.850 --> 40:19.740
to truly feel

40:19.840 --> 40:22.260
the effort you put into quality.

40:26.710 --> 40:28.000
We at Fulaxida

40:28.480 --> 40:29.740
are here to make money,

40:30.880 --> 40:32.010
but at the same time,

40:32.440 --> 40:34.730
we also hope your hard work

40:34.920 --> 40:36.480
can be seen,

40:36.800 --> 40:37.920
recognized,

40:38.320 --> 40:39.360
and trusted!

40:40.320 --> 40:41.300
He has a point.

40:41.320 --> 40:43.040
He has a point. What he said makes sense.

40:43.040 --> 40:45.420
Right? We really didn't lie to you.

40:47.400 --> 40:48.530
They are helping us.

40:50.400 --> 40:51.510
They are helping us.

40:51.510 --> 40:52.710
They are the ones trying to scam us.

40:52.710 --> 40:54.500
He's the one scamming us.

40:56.070 --> 40:56.840
Let's go.

40:56.910 --> 40:57.800
Let's go.

40:57.820 --> 40:59.020
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

40:59.740 --> 41:00.600
Let's go.

41:01.440 --> 41:02.590
Let's go as well.

41:02.670 --> 41:03.860
Now that you understand, please go back.

41:03.860 --> 41:05.920
Really, we're not trying to scam you.

41:06.320 --> 41:07.550
Clear out, everyone.

41:17.130 --> 41:18.440
Don't worry, everyone. There's no rush.

41:18.440 --> 41:19.360
Please don't worry.

41:19.360 --> 41:21.440
Every household will get one.

41:21.460 --> 41:22.880
Because we are going in order,

41:22.880 --> 41:24.570
and we've only installed them
up to the village entrance.

41:24.570 --> 41:25.040
Here's what we do.

41:25.040 --> 41:27.290
Let this young man take down your names.

41:27.320 --> 41:28.460
Yes, I'm in Sichuan.

41:29.630 --> 41:30.510
By the way,

41:30.510 --> 41:32.160
someone in Fulaxida
is stirring up trouble.

41:32.160 --> 41:33.880
Look into it and find out who's behind it.

41:33.880 --> 41:35.340
What's your house number?

41:38.360 --> 41:38.920
Yifei,

41:39.230 --> 41:39.920
I dare say

41:39.920 --> 41:42.230
there's no investor like you—

41:42.480 --> 41:44.680
personally coming to speak to farmers,

41:44.840 --> 41:46.640
even supervising in the fields.

41:47.500 --> 41:49.100
Thank you for your hard work.

41:49.230 --> 41:50.670
Weren't you the one who asked me to come?

41:50.670 --> 41:51.590
I had no choice.

41:52.070 --> 41:53.280
You invested in this project too.

41:53.280 --> 41:54.800
It's like our own flesh and blood.

41:54.800 --> 41:56.320
If you didn't come,
I wouldn't have been able to pull it off.

41:56.320 --> 41:58.280
We can't let the project fail, can we?

41:58.280 --> 42:00.190
So you see, you're basically
pressuring and persuading me

42:00.190 --> 42:01.650
at the same time, you know?

42:01.840 --> 42:04.170
How is that "pressuring and persuading"?

42:05.960 --> 42:08.000
But there's one thing I don't understand.

42:08.000 --> 42:10.550
I heard that anyone
who has worked in finance

42:10.800 --> 42:13.360
rarely wants to make money
from the real economy again.

42:13.360 --> 42:14.620
But you're different.

42:14.670 --> 42:15.920
You have a prestigious job

42:15.920 --> 42:18.320
and Qiansheng Manufacturing
to fall back on,

42:18.320 --> 42:20.630
yet instead of focusing on
such brilliant careers,

42:20.630 --> 42:22.030
you're fixated on

42:22.360 --> 42:24.290
our digital agriculture startup.

42:24.320 --> 42:25.050
Do you really

42:25.110 --> 42:26.570
have that much faith in us?

42:29.550 --> 42:31.910
Didn't you say it yourself
at the venture capital conference

42:31.910 --> 42:34.330
that rural revitalization
is a national strategy?

42:34.330 --> 42:36.360
This is definitely
a new wave of the times,

42:36.360 --> 42:36.920
right?

42:37.440 --> 42:38.760
And its impact

42:38.920 --> 42:40.210
is no less significant than

42:40.210 --> 42:42.030
the reform and opening up era
my father experienced decades ago.

42:42.030 --> 42:43.670
So sometimes I find myself thinking that,

42:43.670 --> 42:44.550
whether Fulaxida can actually

42:44.550 --> 42:45.880
make money in the end—

42:47.110 --> 42:49.840
it doesn't really seem that important
after all.

42:52.090 --> 42:53.810
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.230 --> 42:54.850
You know,

42:54.870 --> 42:56.930
I used to be in a very similar situation
to yours.

42:56.930 --> 42:58.240
My relationship with my wife

42:58.240 --> 42:59.280
got stuck in overthinking.

42:59.280 --> 43:01.410
But I forgot the most important thing—

43:01.690 --> 43:02.280
feeling.

43:03.650 --> 43:05.210
As long as the feeling is right,

43:05.210 --> 43:06.140
then it's right.

43:12.070 --> 43:13.000
Everyone!

43:13.670 --> 43:14.430
Everyone,

43:14.620 --> 43:16.080
open your eyes wide and see

43:16.090 --> 43:17.150
who's here!

43:19.010 --> 43:20.020
Come on in.

43:20.330 --> 43:21.440
Hello, everyone.
